// Things worn on the face, drawn over the outfit and under the hair. Beards are in the hair slot, so they match it.
// Lenses keep the eye's iris (g, the eyes slot), so a chosen eye colour still shows through glasses.
// 25 x 35 (CHARS-B, 2026-10-10): the eyes are rows 14 to 16 (cols 8-9 and 15-16); lens rims are ink.

legend M cloth_pink.0

// A full beard in the hair slot, four rows under the eyes (the guildmaster, the smith, the quartermaster).
sprite face/beard 25 35

